---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about NYCUNO, an affordable ride-hailing service in New York City."
  currentPage="About Us"
>
  <main>
    <section class="bg-white px-0 py-[50px]">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-[15px]">
        <h1
          class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
        >
          About Us
        </h1>

        <div class="text-[15px] font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
          <p class="mb-7">
            Welcome to NYCUNO, your affordable alternative to luxury
            ride-hailing services in the heart of New York City. Born out of
            a desire to make premium transportation accessible to everyone,
            we’re redefining what it means to travel in style without
            breaking the bank.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-7">
            At NYCUNO, we believe that comfort, convenience, and class
            shouldn’t come with an exorbitant price tag. Whether you're
            heading to a business meeting, a night on the town, or just need
            a reliable ride home, our meticulously maintained fleet of
            vehicles offers a touch of elegance at prices designed for
            everyday use. From sleek sedans to spacious SUVs, every vehicle
            is equipped with modern amenities to ensure your journey is as
            smooth as it is enjoyable.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-7">
            Our professional drivers are more than chauffeurs—they’re locals
            who know NYC like the back of their hand. With safety and
            punctuality as top priorities, they’ll get you where you need to
            go quickly and efficiently while offering a level of hospitality
            that makes each trip feel special.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-7">
            We understand life in the city moves fast, which is why booking
            with NYCUNO is simple—just tap, track, and glide away! No hidden
            fees, no complicated memberships, just straightforward pricing
            and exceptional service tailored to fit your lifestyle.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-7">
            So whether you're commuting through Manhattan, exploring
            Brooklyn, or catching a flight from JFK, let NYCUNO be your
            trusted partner for rides that combine affordability,
            sophistication, and ease. Because getting around NYC shouldn’t
            cost a fortune—it should feel like freedom.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            Experience the NYCUNO difference today: Where Luxury Meets
            Affordability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
